@.str.63 = private unnamed_addr constant [913 x i8] c"Convert a TriangleMeshModel (e.g. as read from a file with\0A`open3d.io.read_triangle_mesh_model()`) to a dictionary of mesh names to\0Atriangle meshes with the specified vertex and triangle dtypes and moved to the\0Aspecified device. Only a single material per mesh is supported. Materials common\0Ato multiple meshes will be duplicated. Textures (as t.geometry.Image) will use\0Ashared storage on the CPU (GPU resident images for textures is not yet supported).\0A\0AReturns:\0A    Dictionary of names to triangle meshes.\0A\0AExample:\0A    Converting the FlightHelmetModel to a dictionary of triangle meshes::\0A\0A        flight_helmet = o3d.data.FlightHelmetModel()\0A        model = o3d.io.read_triangle_model(flight_helmet.path)\0A        mesh_dict = o3d.t.geometry.TriangleMesh.from_triangle_mesh_model(model)\0A        o3d.visualization.draw(list({\22name\22: name, \22geometry\22: tmesh} for\0A            (name, tmesh) in mesh_dict.items()))\0A\00", align 1
